족들도 적지 않다. 달리기 좋은 계절, ‘한강 런’에 이어 ‘호반 런’으로 뜨고 있는 의암호 순환 코스, 호반 둘레길 등을 따라가 봤다.","date":"2025-10-24T15:45:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2025/10/25/KPYTYILULZDJBP5BG533TJWJZA/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"시민단체, 이상경 전 차관 고발 “사의 표명으로 될 문제 아니다”","partialText":"","date":"2025-10-25T09:02:03.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/national_general/2025/10/25/QQRSDWXOQJFRTNF75VEV65JJBM/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"의협 “성분명 처방·한의사 X레이 등 총력 저지할 것”","partialText":"","date":"2025-10-25T11:07:51.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/welfare-medical/2025/10/25/DSILYXA7TZEQTD2VUYE3NPGVP4/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"낯선 샴페인에서, 우리 전통주 향을 느꼈다","partialText":"","date":"2025-10-24T15:33:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2025/10/25/6WLASTTQFZHSPA5VJQNZYSYKIU/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/national/?outputType=xml"},"title":"“양평 공무원 죽음엔 왜 아무말 없나”... 대통령의 선택적 감수성","partialText":"","date":"2025-10-24T15:45:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/national/weekend/2025/10/25/MUKTBDDHZNAGHMORA7FSVPRVAM/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"사회","categories":["society"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/